        <mxCell id="note3" value="&lt;b&gt;Design note:&lt;/b&gt; C-05 boundary: personal section selection is not enrollment and never reserves a seat. Multiple timetable alternatives may exist under a plan, but no more than one is selected (partial unique index). GPA_ENTRY is separate from course planning, references COURSE and SEMESTER, and resolves input via GPA_SCALE. GPA labels/boundaries/points remain OPEN for TA confirmation." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F8FB;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
